External dependencies are NOT included in this repository. Building requires
Xilinx Vivado/Vitis 2025.2 and a GNU Arm GCC toolchain; running the board
application requires a PYNQ Linux image (Python 3.8+/NumPy); the host GUI uses
PySide6 and pyqtgraph; the SDR testbench uses GNU Radio 3.10.12, gr-iio and
libiio/PlutoSDR (GPL-3.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-or-later - see
sdr_testbench/README.md); ML training uses PyTorch. Install and use these
according to their own licenses. No dependency binaries are redistributed here.

Reference-only material is intentionally excluded from this repository:
rf_overlay/rtl_ref/ (third-party pin constraints, not a build input),
sdr_testbench/generated/ and sdr_testbench/gui_demo/generated/ (GNU Radio
Companion output, regenerable), raw evidence/IQ data, bitstreams/HWH files,
training datasets, images, and build outputs.

